{"id":"d1f60025fbf6594d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/639_MITL.md","title":"639 MITL","display":"639_MITL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始有理区间集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}=\\{(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r):l,r\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\},\\ l\\le r,\\ \\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}=\\{(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r):l,r\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\},\\ l\\le r,\\ \\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r)\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}\">\\(I=(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r)\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}\\)</span> 定义点集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\n=\n\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\n((\\epsilon_l=1\\wedge l\\le t)\\vee(\\epsilon_l=0\\wedge l&lt;t))\n\\wedge\n((r=\\infty)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=1\\wedge t\\le r)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=0\\wedge t&lt;r))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\n=\n\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\n((\\epsilon_l=1\\wedge l\\le t)\\vee(\\epsilon_l=0\\wedge l&lt;t))\n\\wedge\n((r=\\infty)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=1\\wedge t\\le r)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=0\\wedge t&lt;r))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义非点区间谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NonPunct}_{639}(I)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\,(s&lt;t\\wedge s\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\\wedge t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NonPunct}_{639}(I)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\,(s&lt;t\\wedge s\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\\wedge t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>同时定义点区间谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Punct}_{639}:\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}\\to\\{0,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Punct}_{639}(I)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists!t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\ (t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Punct}_{639}:\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}\\to\\{0,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Punct}_{639}(I)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists!t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\ (t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>非点区间集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}=\\{I\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}:\\operatorname{NonPunct}_{639}(I)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}=\\{I\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}:\\operatorname{NonPunct}_{639}(I)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\cap\\{I\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}:\\operatorname{Punct}_{639}(I)\\}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\cap\\{I\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}:\\operatorname{Punct}_{639}(I)\\}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且每个公式形成、公理实例和满足子句中的区间参数都必须先属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\">\\(\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639}J\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(J),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639}J\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(J),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in_{639}I\">\\(t\\in_{639}I\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\">\\(t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本文件将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\">\\(\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\)</span> 作为原始参数集合，并定义谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\)</span>。原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{until}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{until}_I\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,U_I\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(A\\,U_I\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{639},\\operatorname{BV}_{639}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{639},\\operatorname{BV}_{639}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(A\\,U_I\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(A\\,U_I\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{639}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{639}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{639}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{639}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{639}\\)</span> 为所有有限支撑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span> 的集合，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{639}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{639}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是有限集。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{639}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{639}\\)</span> 唯一扩张为函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{639}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{639}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(A\\,U_I\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(A)\\,U_I\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(A\\,U_I\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(A)\\,U_I\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{639}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,639}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,639}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{639}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{639}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{639}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{639}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{639}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{639}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>MITL 区间侧条件不是公式公理。其形式对象是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{WFInt}_{639}=\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{WFInt}_{639}=\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>MITL 区间公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{IntMon}^{639}=\\{(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\to(A\\,U_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},I,J\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639}J\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{IntMon}^{639}=\\{(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\to(A\\,U_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},I,J\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639}J\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{639}=\\{B\\to(A\\,U_I\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639},0\\in_{639}I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{639}=\\{B\\to(A\\,U_I\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639},0\\in_{639}I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{639}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{639}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{639}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{639}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{IntMon}^{639}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{639}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{639}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{639}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{639}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{639}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{IntMon}^{639}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{639}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{639}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{639}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{IntIncl}^{639}=\\{((A\\,U_I\\,B),A\\,U_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},I,J\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639}J\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{IntIncl}^{639}=\\{((A\\,U_I\\,B),A\\,U_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},I,J\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639}J\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqI}^{639}=\\{((A\\leftrightarrow C,\\ B\\leftrightarrow D),(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,U_I\\,D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqI}^{639}=\\{((A\\leftrightarrow C,\\ B\\leftrightarrow D),(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,U_I\\,D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{639}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{639}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{IntIncl}^{639}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqI}^{639}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{639}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{639}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{IntIncl}^{639}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqI}^{639}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Line}_{639}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{639})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Line}_{639}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{639})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{639}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{639})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Line}_{639}^{\\,m}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{639}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{639})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Line}_{639}^{\\,m}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span>。证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{639}^{\\,m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{639}^{\\,m}\\)</span>。每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{639}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{639}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,I,J\">\\(A,B,I,J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\,U_I\\,B\">\\(A_j=A\\,U_I\\,B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\\,U_J\\,B\">\\(A_i=A\\,U_J\\,B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639}J\">\\(I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639}J\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,D,I\">\\(A,B,C,D,I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow C\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=B\\leftrightarrow D\">\\(A_k=B\\leftrightarrow D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,U_I\\,D)\">\\(A_i=(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,U_I\\,D)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_k=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_k=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{639}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{639}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在证明行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta_i,A)\">\\((\\Delta_i,A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{639}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{639}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{639}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{639}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>MITL 的目标差异是禁止点区间：所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_I\">\\(U_I\\)</span> 构造子要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\)</span>。因此 punctual 约束不是可形成公式。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-非点区间实时迹\">10. 非点区间实时迹</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r)\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}\">\\(I=(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r)\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}\\)</span>，定义其实数点集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\n=\n\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\n((\\epsilon_l=1\\wedge l\\le t)\\vee(\\epsilon_l=0\\wedge l&lt;t))\n\\wedge\n((r=\\infty)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=1\\wedge t\\le r)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=0\\wedge t&lt;r))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\n=\n\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\n((\\epsilon_l=1\\wedge l\\le t)\\vee(\\epsilon_l=0\\wedge l&lt;t))\n\\wedge\n((r=\\infty)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=1\\wedge t\\le r)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=0\\wedge t&lt;r))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义实时迹集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TTrace}_{639}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TTrace}_{639}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-满足关系\">11. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{639}\\subseteq\\mathsf{TTrace}_{639}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{639}\\subseteq\\mathsf{TTrace}_{639}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为满足下列递归子句的最小关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{639}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{639}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{639}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{639}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{639}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{639}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}A\\,U_I\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nI\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\wedge\n\\exists u\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\,\n\\bigl(t\\le u\\wedge u-t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\\wedge\n\\nu,u\\Vdash_{639}B\\wedge\n\\forall v\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}(t\\le v&lt;u\\to\\nu,v\\Vdash_{639}A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}A\\,U_I\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nI\\in\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\wedge\n\\exists u\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\,\n\\bigl(t\\le u\\wedge u-t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\\wedge\n\\nu,u\\Vdash_{639}B\\wedge\n\\forall v\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}(t\\le v&lt;u\\to\\nu,v\\Vdash_{639}A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-语义后果\">12. 语义后果</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{639}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{639}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{TTrace}_{639}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{TTrace}_{639}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\Vdash_{639}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{639}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}:\\varnothing\\models_{639}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{639}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{639}:\\varnothing\\models_{639}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{MITL}_{639}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639},\\operatorname{Punct}_{639},\\operatorname{NonPunct}_{639},\\mathsf{NInt}_{639},\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},\\operatorname{FV}_{639},\\operatorname{BV}_{639},\\mathsf{Subst}_{639},\\widehat\\sigma_{639},\\equiv_{\\alpha,639},\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639},\\mathsf{Ax}_{639},\\mathsf{Rule}_{639},\\mathsf{Line}_{639},\\mathsf{Proof}_{639},\\vdash_{639},\\mathsf{Thm}_{639}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{MITL}_{639}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639},\\operatorname{Punct}_{639},\\operatorname{NonPunct}_{639},\\mathsf{NInt}_{639},\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},\\operatorname{FV}_{639},\\operatorname{BV}_{639},\\mathsf{Subst}_{639},\\widehat\\sigma_{639},\\equiv_{\\alpha,639},\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639},\\mathsf{Ax}_{639},\\mathsf{Rule}_{639},\\mathsf{Line}_{639},\\mathsf{Proof}_{639},\\vdash_{639},\\mathsf{Thm}_{639}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>扩展后的完整对象为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{MITL}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{639}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639},\\operatorname{Punct}_{639},\\operatorname{NonPunct}_{639},\\mathsf{NInt}_{639},\\operatorname{Pt}_{639},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},\\operatorname{FV}_{639},\\operatorname{BV}_{639},\\mathsf{Subst}_{639},\\widehat\\sigma_{639},\\equiv_{\\alpha,639},\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639},\n\\mathsf{TTrace}_{639},\\Vdash_{639},\\models_{639},\\mathsf{Val}_{639},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{639},\\mathsf{Rule}_{639},\\mathsf{Line}_{639},\\mathsf{Proof}_{639},\\vdash_{639},\\mathsf{Thm}_{639}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{MITL}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{639}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639},\\operatorname{Punct}_{639},\\operatorname{NonPunct}_{639},\\mathsf{NInt}_{639},\\operatorname{Pt}_{639},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{639},\\operatorname{FV}_{639},\\operatorname{BV}_{639},\\mathsf{Subst}_{639},\\widehat\\sigma_{639},\\equiv_{\\alpha,639},\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639},\n\\mathsf{TTrace}_{639},\\Vdash_{639},\\models_{639},\\mathsf{Val}_{639},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{639},\\mathsf{Rule}_{639},\\mathsf{Line}_{639},\\mathsf{Proof}_{639},\\vdash_{639},\\mathsf{Thm}_{639}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含非点区间实时迹语义；不含点区间约束、自动机翻译或可判定性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-非点区间实时迹","text":"10. 非点区间实时迹","level":1},{"id":"11.-满足关系","text":"11. 满足关系","level":1},{"id":"12.-语义后果","text":"12. 语义后果","level":1},{"id":"13.-整个形式系统","text":"13. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}=\\{(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r):l,r\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\},\\ l\\le r,\\ \\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"I=(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r)\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\n=\n\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\n((\\epsilon_l=1\\wedge l\\le t)\\vee(\\epsilon_l=0\\wedge l<t))\n\\wedge\n((r=\\infty)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=1\\wedge t\\le r)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=0\\wedge t<r))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NonPunct}_{639}(I)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\,(s<t\\wedge s\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\\wedge t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Punct}_{639}:\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}\\to\\{0,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Punct}_{639}(I)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists!t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\ (t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}=\\{I\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}:\\operatorname{NonPunct}_{639}(I)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}\\cap\\{I\\in\\mathsf{RawInt}_{639}:\\operatorname{Punct}_{639}(I)\\}=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NInt}_{639}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{639}J\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(I)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pt}_{639}(J),","display":true},{"tex":"t\\in_{639}I","display":false},{"tex":"t\\i